nch","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Vietnamese","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","review_id":"djivGyip2Uo3Mol_NLsIJg","date":"2021-11-14T05:34:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9544107913970947,"text_excerpt":"While New Orleans isn't lacking Vietnamese food, Elizabeth Street Cafe does not disappoint. Located at St. Vincent, the patio is a beautiful spot to grab lunch and drinks. I will be returning for happy hour: half off báhn mi and appetizers. Everything we ordered enjoyed immensely. The portions are much larger than we anticipated (example A: huge spring rolls). Ginger chili-oil dumpling were delightful as was the Redfish Fried Rice. Regretfully, I was too full for dessert but the eclairs and croissants were calling my name as I left..."},{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","review_id":"dIVzFHIkjwlU7kaXjzV4aQ","date":"2021-11-04T18:16:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9501200318336487,"text_excerpt":"I had a good meal at Elizabeth Street Cafe! They have a happy hour from 3-6 PM on weekdays where there is half off appetizers and bahn mis. I got the chili oil dumplings which I really enjoyed though they were not super spicy. I also got the grilled pork bahn mi which was pretty good though the meat was a little dry. The service was great and it is very pleasant to eat outside under the umbrellas and misters. I would go back to try more of the menu."},{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","review_id":"5yblWqnzwPMt6OvNBtU8CQ","date":"2021-10-24T13:02:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9336023330688477,"text_excerpt":"This is a charming little joint outside the Hotel St. Vincent. It could be easy to miss the unassuming spot because it's nestled into the parking lot, but totally worth it. The Vietnamese menu hits the spot. I got the tofu banh mi, which was a perfect portion to fill me up. One of my friends got a noodle bowl, and I was astonished at how big the serving was. Didn't keep him from finishing, though. I wish I would have gotten some pictures of the food and the space, but hopefully I'll be back at some point, maybe during the day for better lighting, and can remedy that. The service was also phenomenal."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","photo_id":"RqxrZix6q-Z-L7g3Eny1FQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RqxrZix6q-Z-L7g3Eny1FQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9196427464485168},{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","photo_id":"8q_CWBQLAlXC202Xl758fg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8q_CWBQLAlXC202Xl758fg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.906353235244751},{"business_id":"3CcQS_pHoq9RPaOWYlo_7Q","photo_id":"OQW7TBwdEwpCXM5KGYIz7w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OQW7TBwdEwpCXM5KGYIz7w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8474276065826416}]},"notebook_case":null}
